alchemy-provider-telnyx

vendor/distilled-telnyx/ is generated with distilled (https://github.com/alchemy-run/distilled,
Apache-2.0) from the Telnyx OpenAPI spec (https://github.com/team-telnyx/openapi). Its hand-written
runtime files and generator config are adapted from distilled's packages.

The resource modeling in src/ (which operations make up each resource, its identity, which props
force replacement, and the special-case behaviour of 28 resources) follows terraform-provider-telnyx
by Roman Baron (https://github.com/RomansWorks/terraform-provider-telnyx), licensed under the
Apache License 2.0.

